  "trace": "index authenticated /api/publish mount -> sync-electron-secrets with original issued request actor -> exact owned projects repository -> canonical current github and finite apikey_electron_* source rows -> bounded manual official repository public-key GET -> libsodium sealed box -> existing managed Vault producer attestation with original actor, repository, nonce and canonical parameter digest -> existing durable BusinessAction confirmation -> explicit actual DesktopSigningSetup approval click -> exact native-operation confirmation route -> original WeakMap authority permit and current durable claim -> authenticated producer proof plus current project/source/connection/key -> egressPolicy USER_PRIVATE ciphertext wrapper and protected decision -> one canonical consume -> current durable approval plus source/connection/project/expiry recheck -> exact fixed GitHub PUT ->201/204 acknowledgement -> post-read checks -> original durable finish receipt.",
  "defects": [
    "Raw user ID could authorize signing credential reads and exports",
